{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/build-your-blob.png?t=1749331199\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/attaching-thin-lq2.gif?t=1749331199\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Amalgun, every enemy can be knocked out and attached to. Use and experiment with a variety of different amalgoms, each with their own abilities and evolutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/merging-thin-lq.gif?t=1749331199\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Match three amalgoms of the same type to merge and evolve them, providing unique upgrades to their powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/weave-around-attacks.png?t=1749331199\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As your blob grows and changes shape, you'll need to adapt to dash and twist around enemies. The ability to rotate and turn around bullets adds a unique dimension to a combat system that is easy to learn but hard to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/accessorize-and-augment.png?t=1749331199\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/buying-thin-lq.gif?t=1749331199\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find and buy accessories for your amalgoms to augment their abilities (and up their fashion). Further upgrade your build with a variety of perks to make a blob all your own.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/team-up.png?t=1749331199\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/co-op-thin-lq.gif?t=1749331199\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Optionally bring friends into the fray with 2-4 player local and online co-op.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/discover-amalga.png?t=1749331199\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(planned content) Make your way through the world of Amalga. Encounter and track a variety of amalgom species, earn achievements and spend resources acquired during runs to unlock permanent upgrades, and use your wits and the powers of your amalgoms to uncover Amalga's secrets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/become-unstoppable.png?t=1749331199\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/variety-thin-lq.gif?t=1749331199\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With an assortment of amalgoms, accessories, and perks to try, every run is unique. Make a busted build and create chaos.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3775960?t=1749331199","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/23c90f5c941800414fe7798ed23f40bb1401475d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749331199","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/93e7c53b4928970baa786d7cc7eb09af1425ad13/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749331199","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/93e7c53b4928970baa786d7cc7eb09af1425ad13/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749331199","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/build-your-blob.png?t=1749331199\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/attaching-thin-lq2.gif?t=1749331199\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Amalgun, every enemy can be knocked out and attached to. Use and experiment with a variety of different amalgoms, each with their own abilities and evolutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/merging-thin-lq.gif?t=1749331199\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Match three amalgoms of the same type to merge and evolve them, providing unique upgrades to their powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/weave-around-attacks.png?t=1749331199\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As your blob grows and changes shape, you'll need to adapt to dash and twist around enemies. The ability to rotate and turn around bullets adds a unique dimension to a combat system that is easy to learn but hard to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/accessorize-and-augment.png?t=1749331199\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/buying-thin-lq.gif?t=1749331199\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find and buy accessories for your amalgoms to augment their abilities (and up their fashion). Further upgrade your build with a variety of perks to make a blob all your own.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/team-up.png?t=1749331199\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/co-op-thin-lq.gif?t=1749331199\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Optionally bring friends into the fray with 2-4 player local and online co-op.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/discover-amalga.png?t=1749331199\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(planned content) Make your way through the world of Amalga. Encounter and track a variety of amalgom species, earn achievements and spend resources acquired during runs to unlock permanent upgrades, and use your wits and the powers of your amalgoms to uncover Amalga's secrets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/become-unstoppable.png?t=1749331199\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/variety-thin-lq.gif?t=1749331199\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With an assortment of amalgoms, accessories, and perks to try, every run is unique. Make a busted build and create chaos.</p>","developers":["Knockout Mouse"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_